  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project focuses on the planning situation for Palestinian communities in Area C and Jerusalem, and the impact of settlement activities and the separation wall on Palestinians. It often provides technical support in legal cases for other human rights NGOs, as well as carrying out studies and assessments on the impact of Israeli settlement policy. Elements of the organisation&#x2019;s work also focus on the provision of WASH type facilities and gender.</narrative>
